-art graphics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Incredible bosses are waiting for you at the end of each level;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various weapons;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Classic Arcade Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Couch Co-Op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gamepad support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Save as many prisoners as possible and travel from one mission to another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The process of creating a combat vehicle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825560/extras/2e46831807850b933c40b37d07f404a1.poster.avif?t=1780782887\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825560/extras/2e46831807850b933c40b37d07f404a1.webm?t=1780782887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825560/extras/2e46831807850b933c40b37d07f404a1.mp4?t=1780782887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carjacking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825560/extras/1c4bb14d4eac2cfb8fe29d1f76778dfb.poster.avif?t=1780782887\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825560/extras/1c4bb14d4eac2cfb8fe29d1f76778dfb.webm?t=1780782887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825560/extras/1c4bb14d4eac2cfb8fe29d1f76778dfb.mp4?t=1780782887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c